{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >JUGGLE STAR DX is meant to be played casually. The point of the game is to keep up a ball and ensure it passes all rings in the level or destroys all end goals. As of now, it contains 30+ levels where you can play with keeping up a ball and later on, juggling multiple balls using the paddle.<br><br>Among the levels included are:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dexterity levels</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multi-ball levels</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Physics puzzles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Precision levels</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can play it with a <strong>mouse</strong> or <strong>touchscreen</strong>.\u00a0 <br><br>Other features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Custom soundtrack</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Day/night cycle</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >High rotation audio mechanics</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3204380?t=1772891861","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3204380?t=1772891861","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3204380/84c2c6995fbf66d39578800ab7b40cd4a0369900/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1772891861","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3204380/84c2c6995fbf66d39578800ab7b40cd4a0369900/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1772891861","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >JUGGLE STAR DX is meant to be played casually. The point of the game is to keep up a ball and ensure it passes all rings in the level or destroys all end goals. As of now, it contains 30+ levels where you can play with keepi